Lil Durk @lildurk, Born Durk Derrick Banks, Is One Of Chicago’s Most Influential Rappers And The Founder Of OTF (Only The Family). He Rose From Chicago’s Drill Scene To Become A Global Hip-Hop Star, Known For His Emotional Storytelling, Melodic Style, And Raw Lyrics About His Life And Experiences.

Lil Durk: all-time great or overrated? Be real.

